UID:25d8d2feb2bf14395eac@psc-calendar
CATEGORIES:NOLA,Decision / Order
DESCRIPTION:Commission: New Orleans City Council Utility Committee (NOLA)\
 nType: Decision / Order\nDocket: R-19-285\, R-19-286\n\n&nbsp\; NEW ORLEAN
 S - At today's regular meeting\, the City Council adopted a resolution cal
 ling a special election relative to funding for infrastructure projects\,&
 nbsp\;established regulations for the operation of nursing homes\,&nbsp\;a
 uthorized an honorary street dedication for Father Joseph Pham Van Tue\, c
